<h1>Conversations</h1>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">A message list component for displaying conversations and messages. The container uses <code>h-full</code> to fill its parent's height, so the parent must provide an explicit height. Messages scroll within the available space while the composer stays pinned at the bottom. If you have a title bar or other content above the messages, include it inside the container so the remaining height is calculated correctly.</p>

<div class="l-ui-conversation__container l-ui-utility--mt-xl">
  <div class="l-ui-conversation__messages">
    <div class="l-ui-conversation">
      <div class="l-ui-message">
        <div class="l-ui-message__avatar">AL</div>
        <div class="l-ui-message__bubble">
          <div class="l-ui-message__author">Alice</div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__body">
            Has anyone had a chance to review the pull request? I'd love to get it merged before the end of the week.
          </div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__footer">
            <div class="l-ui-message__timestamp">10:30 AM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="l-ui-message--sent">
        <div class="l-ui-message__bubble">
          <div class="l-ui-message__body">
            I'll take a look this afternoon. The changes look straightforward from the description.
          </div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__footer">
            <div class="l-ui-message__metadata">Claude Opus 4.6 (~128 tokens)</div>
            <div class="l-ui-message__timestamp">10:32 AM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="l-ui-message">
        <div class="l-ui-message__avatar">AL</div>
        <div class="l-ui-message__bubble">
          <div class="l-ui-message__author">Alice</div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__body">
            Thank you! Let me know if you have any questions about the implementation.
          </div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__footer">
            <div class="l-ui-message__metadata">ChatGPT 5.2 (~96 tokens)</div>
            <div class="l-ui-message__timestamp">10:33 AM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="l-ui-conversation__separator">Today</div>

      <div class="l-ui-message">
        <div class="l-ui-message__avatar">BK</div>
        <div class="l-ui-message__bubble">
          <div class="l-ui-message__author">Bob</div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__body">
            I left a few comments on the PR. Nothing major, just some suggestions for the error handling.
          </div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__footer">
            <div class="l-ui-message__metadata">Claude Opus 4.6 (~215 tokens)</div>
            <div class="l-ui-message__timestamp">10:45 AM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="l-ui-message--sent">
        <div class="l-ui-message__bubble">
          <div class="l-ui-message__body">
            Good catches, Bob. I agree with both suggestions.
          </div>
          <div class="l-ui-message__footer">
            <div class="l-ui-message__metadata">ChatGPT 5.2 (~84 tokens)</div>
            <div class="l-ui-message__timestamp">11:02 AM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="l-ui-conversation__composer">
    <textarea class="l-ui-conversation__composer-input" placeholder="Type a message..." rows="1"></textarea>
    <button class="l-ui-button--icon" aria-label="Send">
      <svg class="l-ui-icon--sm" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12 3.269 3.125A59.769 59.769 0 0 1 21.485 12 59.768 59.768 0 0 1 3.27 20.875L5.999 12Zm0 0h7.5"></path>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="l-ui-utility--mt-xl" data-controller="l-ui--modal">
  <button class="l-ui-button--outline" data-action="l-ui--modal#open">View code</button>
  <dialog class="l-ui-modal" data-l-ui--modal-target="dialog" data-action="click->l-ui--modal#closeOnBackdrop">
    <div class="l-ui-modal__header">
      <h3>Conversation container</h3>
      <button class="l-ui-button--icon" data-action="l-ui--modal#close">
        <svg class="l-ui-icon--sm" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="l-ui-modal__body">
      <code class="l-ui-surface">&lt;div class="l-ui-conversation__container"&gt;
  &lt;div class="l-ui-conversation__messages"&gt;
    &lt;div class="l-ui-conversation"&gt;
      &lt;!-- Messages go here --&gt;
      &lt;div class="l-ui-message"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div class="l-ui-message--sent"&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class="l-ui-conversation__composer"&gt;
    &lt;textarea class="l-ui-conversation__composer-input"
      placeholder="Type a message..." rows="1"&gt;
    &lt;/textarea&gt;
    &lt;button class="l-ui-button--icon"&gt;
      &lt;svg&gt;...&lt;/svg&gt;
    &lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</code>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>

